+ *
+ * The DirectX 1-3 interface (DPLAY.DLL games: Necrodome), answering as Windows' dplayx does - learned
+ * black-box only (okplay/tests/apistate_dp1.c through apidiff.sh, 2026-10-22; docs/DPLAY_CONFORMANCE.md).
